      "iast": "kailāsa śikhare baddhvā munīnām agrataḥ paṇam |\nraviḥ syāt anuyātavyo yāvat astam mahāgirim",
      "translation": "\"Before the sages on the peak of Mt. Kailash we have staked a stake that we two shall follow the Sun till he reaches the great westerly mountain, namely Mt. Dusk...",
